<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/assertion> {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Assessment> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The holdout thread scored the blind Aves predictions inconclusive on all three pre-registered measures (A_keel: inconclusive, B_webbing: inconclusive, C_conflict_free: inconclusive)." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Scored by the holdout thread under a rule it registered before opening the prediction file. All three measures returned inconclusive with nothing scored: measure A (a sternal keel) had 0 of 48 species scored, measure B (foot webbing) 0 of 48, and measure C (conflict-free reporting) found no conflicts reported for 48 of 48. The reason is that the rule's structures are not among the Uberon terms that carry a taxon constraint, so the prediction panel never contains them. That is the rule meeting the panel, not a pass and not a failure. This record is a transcription of that thread's published result file; the scoring was run by that thread, not by this one." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasVerdict> "inconclusive" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evaluatesHypothesis> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/organism-aves-blind-predictions> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "pre-registered holdout exam, Aves roster" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "holdout/exam-results/organism-design/result.run2.json" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "sha256:2254c4ba8fb3067081eb4a4c27e65bf90ab33ce637a39095f75977f181d7ff4f" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi/blob/main/holdout/exam-results/organism-design/PREREG.md> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi/blob/main/holdout/exam-results/organism-design/result.run2.json> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Does not establish: that the predictions are right or wrong. An inconclusive exam measured nothing; the pre-registered structures were outside the panel the predictions could cover." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/organism-aves-blind-predictions> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasAssessment> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/organism-aves-blind-predictions--holdout-scoring> .
}
